      "settings": {
        "how_it_works_video": "shopify://files/videos/1019 (1).mp4",
        "eyebrow": "HOW IT WORKS",
        "heading": "",
        "subheading": "The Altaeron™ Adjustable Bunion Corrector administers advanced alignment therapy. It's designed to <strong class=\"alta-custom__emphasis\">support the realignment</strong> of the big toe and gradually alleviate inflammation by using an adjustable hinge joint mechanism.\n\nIt helps release muscular tension by simply pulling your big toe back to its natural position, resulting in pain-free natural realignment of your toe joint over time.\n\nThis releases years of built up tension, straightens and shrinks the bunion, reduces pain, and prevents further growth to get you back on your feet to stand tall and confident again.\n\nSome users may require a session or two to get used to it, as the <strong class=\"alta-custom__emphasis\">sensation may feel more robust compared to other methods</strong>.\n\nThis is a natural and non-invasive way of restoring the natural position of the toe, foot, and reversing the damage caused by ill-fitting footwear or genetics.\n\nWhether it's a small child's foot or an adult size 13, the Altaeron™ Adjustable Bunion Corrector is crafted to fit all foot sizes comfortably.",
        "reassurance": "<strong class=\"alta-custom__reassurance-title\">Visible Progress Can Start Within the First Month</strong><br><strong>87% of users reported visible improvements within the first month.</strong><br>A reason to start addressing toe alignment instead of waiting for crowding and discomfort to become a bigger part of everyday life."
      }
    },
