        "reviewer_name_1": "Linda",
        "review_content_1": "<p>my right bunion has been bugging me forever especially after work or if i wear the wrong shoes. first time i put this thing on i turned it way too much lol had to take it off and start over 😅 now i just use it when im sitting on the couch at night, maybe 20-30 mins. feels weird at first but i actually like the little stretch now. keeps my big toe from feeling so jammed up against the other one</p>",
