        "avatar_url_2": "https://review-images.judgeme.com/altaeron/1789792345__a1f6c4391f1d34e6998ceec28c924062fnjpg_96__original.png?quality=80&width=160",
        "reviewer_name_2": "debbie",
        "review_content_2": "<p>Ive been wearing it around 30 mins a day, mostly after being on my feet, and it helps with the tension and discomfort. for me its more of a comfortable support/immobilizing brace than a “corrector” and im totally fine with that. feels well made and comfortable to wear ❤️‍🔥</p>"
