        "body": "Bunions can affect more than the way your foot looks. The pressure can follow you through work, errands, exercise, and the moments when you finally sit down to rest.\n\nAnd when you begin noticing your big toe shifting further toward the next toe, it is natural to wonder whether the change will become more difficult to manage.\n\nBunions can progress over time. In some cases, increasing deformity can contribute to overlapping toes, corns, calluses, and additional foot discomfort. More advanced cases may require professional treatment, including surgery.\n\nYou don't have to ignore the changes you're noticing.\n\nThe Altaeron™ Adjustable Bunion Corrector combines a structured hinge-joint design with adjustable tension to provide a targeted, non-surgical approach to bunion care. Use it for around 30 minutes a day, gradually adjusting the tension to your comfort level as part of your at-home routine.",
